OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight rain will clear from  
OL,6,Fthe west this morning. Otherwise       
OL,7,Fbecoming mainly dry with sunshine by   
OL,8,Fthis afternoon, the odd shower across  
OL,9,FArgyll. Light southwesterly wind.      
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with 
OL,12,Fsome frost and fog patches. Then it    
OL,13,Fwill stay dry for the rest of the      
OL,14,Fnight but clouding over later.         
OL,16,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start it will be 
OL,17,Fa cloudy day with a chance of rain     
OL,18,Fspreading north in the afternoon, but  
OL,19,Fmore especially in the evening.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
